{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-5","storyName":"注目礼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"莱茵与高登的秘密双双暴露，展会筹备陷入停滞，但负责审理特殊事故的听证会迟迟没有召开。斯凯带人极力保护莱茵的“树”，而古斯塔夫和梅兰德都已强势介入园区。然而此时，关键人物娜斯提却不见了踪影。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["愤怒的公司代表","急切的公司代表","工作人员","园区警卫","斯凯","研究员","？？？","体验员B","体验员A","梅希亚","拂哀菈","奥克里","费尔南","高登","太空鳞兽","古斯塔夫","科学顾问","体验员","协会成员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act15_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_sys_act15_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","channel":"f","volume":"0","id":10},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的公司代表","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*天上飘着的那棵树到底是怎么回事？","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的公司代表","text":"展会没几天就要开幕了，你数数它占了几家公司的展位？莱茵生命可没有申请上层的展示权限！","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的公司代表","text":"一定是莱茵和管理局官员私相授受！昨晚我亲眼看到了全程，园区负责人高登长官就在那棵树上！","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的公司代表","text":"前管理局局长古斯塔夫在广播里打包票，声称第二天早上一定会给我们一个交代，结果呢？","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的公司代表","text":"都这个时候了，听证会一点动静都没有，故意拖时间是不是！","id":16},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"请各位少安毋躁。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"本次事件关乎数百家企业对园区的工程部和行政部的信任问题，我们需要时间谨慎处理，力求给各位最满意的处理方案。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的公司代表","text":"谁要你们谨慎处理了？","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"嗯？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"charslot","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的公司代表","text":"上天的又不是第二个环形实验室，有什么大惊小怪的？","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的公司代表","text":"工程部负责的检修早就停了，行政部的资质审查也结束了，现在这个节骨眼谁还会计较园区的部门负责人是否渎职？","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"可举行听证会是必要的监察流程……","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的公司代表","text":"要调查还是审判是你们的事，我们只想立马知道听证会的最终结果——","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的公司代表","text":"这场必定能轰动哥伦比亚乃至整个泰拉的“天空生活展会”，到底还能不能开？","id":36},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_68_g9_treeplatform_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"让开。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-80","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sit_tatami","volume":"1","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"我再说一遍，让开。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"你们这些研究员，真当自己坐在这里我就没办法动你们背后的非法设备了？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"在听证会正式开始之前，它仍是莱茵生命的财产。再说了，非法设备？","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"警卫先生，你难道没认出来这只是一个“浮空种植单元”吗？你身边飘浮的那些树苗，跟我们背后的这棵，没有区别啊？","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"强词夺理……来人！","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"30,0","duration":"1.2","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"……斯凯，我们人手不够，如果对方动用强制手段，我们撑不了多久。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_529_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"更何况我们也不知道身后的树形装置是否违规、有没有危险。毕竟两年前，克丽斯腾总辖不就是……","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_529_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,-80","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我只问你一个问题，作为一名科学家，你甘心把娜斯提主任的科研成果拱手让人吗？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"不，但……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_529_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"那就先行动起来，别让自己后悔。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"啧，莱茵留驻园区的人数受限，我们的人还是太少了，要是……","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你是不是忘了我们也是莱茵生命的雇员，斯凯先生？","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"false","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1.7","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我不想把你们牵扯进来。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"你是指听证会的调查？别瞎担心了，诬告和罪名我们哪样见得少过？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"早点喊我们，这群警卫说不定都上不了这个浮空平台。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"怎么，从贫民窟征集来的体验员还想逞英雄？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"藏匿非法设备、破坏他人财物、知情不报……光这些罪名就足够把你们打包送进监狱！","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"要不是娜斯提主任收留我，我现在可能已经在监狱里了。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"要动树，就从我们身上跨过去。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"好……那就别怪我动手了！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"1","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"莱茵研究员和体验员组成的人墙死死拦着蛮横的警卫，好事的围观者站在外围，仰头看着这棵突兀的“树”。","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"人群背后，一个陌生高大的黑影走过，脚步铮铮。","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#5$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这就是莱茵的……“树”。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","channel":"crowd","loop":"true","volume":"0.4","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonering","channel":"phone","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","channel":"phone","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"前辈，辛苦了。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"别那么生分，梅希亚。我前段时间一直都在休假，哪有工作让我劳神？","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您来参加听证会？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"嗯，梅兰德应急管理监督协会的徽章设计得还不错，你也可以戴个试试。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我的任务正式结束了？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我们的任务才刚刚开始。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"听您安排。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不用着急。最近几天真是意外不断，除了娜斯提和高登·谭农之外，还有什么我不知道的故事？","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……没有。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不错。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"五分钟之后索道站见。这座园区令人眼花缭乱，我需要一位“本地向导”，带我好好参观一下这座“螺旋桨天堂”。","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"好。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","channel":"phone","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"（破碎的呓语）","id":185},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"抱歉，我应该提前把窗户关上的。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"街道上有公司代表和体验员在游行，听证会拖得越久，他们就越不安。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openwindow","volume":"1","id":192},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"crowd","fadetime":"1","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"好一点了吗，拂哀菈女士？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"（微弱的呼吸）","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#4$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您的身体状况很糟。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"既然您已经见到了娜斯提主任，不如我将您送回河谷——","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"不……不……","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您又像昨晚一样拒绝了我。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"拂哀菈女士，接下来的几天，园区会变得更加嘈杂。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"再想离开，可就没有那么轻松了。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomB.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":224,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","duration":"0.8","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"我们又被抓起来了，连牢房编号都没变！","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"听证会的时间一改再改……你说他们是不是在找更多证据，打算数罪并罚？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"……","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"话说在前头，要是问起我们的身份，我一定会如实供述，你才是那个冒牌货！","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"……","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"喂，你别不说话啊，搞得我心里发毛……","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"其实荒原上的移动监狱也能开发成不错的旅游景点。不过从外面闯进去和从里面逃出来的难度可完全不一样，得小心一点。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"都到这种时候了，你还在评估旅游路线吗？","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"弄丢了一个客人不算，你还要把另一个关进牢里？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我会找到那位女士，至于你，不用太担心。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"你怎么知道？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"没有审讯，没有身份核查，没有出庭通知……你觉得那些警卫是在拖延时间给我们编罪名？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"是。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我倒觉得这恰好能证明——","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"这场听证会的主角，不是我们。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_bg_68_g7_airrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","duration":"0.8","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"费尔南和奥克里被关进牢里，小梅昨天晚上就不见了，注册大厅的电话占线，所有人都在找我跟娜斯提……","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#5$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"好，是时候把从管理局学的东西演给那个老东西看看了，不管他问什么我都能给出解释——我有什么好怕的！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哈，看来老狐狸办事效率不比从前了，到现在都没人来审我。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哎，等等！","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"还好……从终端上看，我现在的头衔还是“螺旋桨天堂”的总长官。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$3","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"嘀——监测到“天空征服者”压力过大，请警惕健康风险，我们的目标在泰拉之外，任重道远。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"……","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"该死的，听证会到底开不开了？要是我来组织，事情早就解决了！那个老东西就是故意给我使绊子，七年前是这样，现在还是这样！","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那你为什么七年以来毫无长进？","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"古斯塔夫长官……","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"说说，如果是你，打算怎么处理？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"这……","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"莱茵的工程检修终止了就沾沾自喜，以为自己可以从此高枕无忧地继续做见不得人的小生意……","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"管理局可不是幼儿园，怎么把你培养得如此天真？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"要不是那棵该死的树，本来一切都很顺利，都怪娜斯提！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"顺利？你知不知道娜斯提手下的一个助理研究员都能看穿你的把戏？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"要不是他跟你一样天真，向我寻求帮助，你的丑事早就被公之于众了。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"……","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"说啊，你打算怎么处理？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"长官……请您帮我……","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"哼。不管莱茵隐瞒这件浮空装置是出于什么样的目的，我们都不能让他们继续为自己的造物定性。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"因为你的失职，本来可以全权接手的行政部一概不能参与评估。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"您的意思是，我们需要引入“第三方”？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"一名客观、专业、看上去中立的科学顾问。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"高登先生，久仰大名。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"他长得可一点也不像科学顾问……他真能处理莱茵的东西？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"charslot","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"为了熟悉我的评估对象，刚刚我去了一趟浮空平台。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问","text":"唔，真是极为壮观的一棵“巨木”，就连“树”下也很热闹。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_68_g9_treeplatform_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":357,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","duration":"0.8","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"来啊！有本事就从我们的尸体上跨过去！","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"（斯凯先生……）","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"（怕什么，唬唬他罢了。）","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"莱茵的科学家是不是被星荚外面的辐射照坏脑子了，你偏要有人流血才善罢甘休？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"既然如此，我就成全你！","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"住手。","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"这身制服……你们是梅兰德的人？","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"我们是梅兰德基金会下属应急管理监督协会成员。根据园区守则，在事故与灾害发生时，本机构将全权接管行政和管理职能。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"您可以向高登长官和古斯塔夫先生确认。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"……","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"charslot","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"监督协会？","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"是的，斯凯先生。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"我们十分理解您的心情，但请不要做出过激举动，我们有权对您和您的同伴采取强制措施。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"所以“螺旋桨天堂”确实进入了紧急状态，昨天晚上的事件在你们的初步调查中被定性为——“特殊事故”？","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"没错。监督协会已经成立特殊调查组，对现场和涉事人员进行取证。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"我们的调查工作还在继续，在缺少官方司法监督机构的情况下，举行听证会是唯一公正的审理手段，希望各位能够耐心等待。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"在听证会召开之前，莱茵是否保有这件“浮空种植单元”的所有权？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"当然。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"希望你们的调查结果，会跟刚刚你给我的结论一样公正。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"请您放心。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"临时浮空平台确认安全，二组继续巡逻。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","id":425},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"斯凯先生，我们就这样走了？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"从警卫的态度来看，梅兰德的管辖权是货真价实的。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"听证会的时间一拖再拖，指不定还会发生什么变数，在这里等下去无益于我们掌握情报，还有……","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你们谁看到娜斯提主任了？","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":439},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":440},{"type":"charslot","id":441},{"type":"background","id":442},{"type":"image","id":443}],"characters":["愤怒的公司代表","急切的公司代表","工作人员","园区警卫","斯凯","研究员","？？？","体验员B","体验员A","梅希亚","拂哀菈","奥克里","费尔南","高登","太空鳞兽","古斯塔夫","科学顾问","体验员","协会成员"]}